"{\"summary\": \"2026-10-20-index-fed-registries-are-their-own-class.md: RegistryFeed is removed; Registry.autoLoaded/KeyedRegistry.autoLoaded return an index-fed class, and a class-keyed registry the index fills must extend IndexFedClassKeyedRegistry with a one-argument super(id) (lines 34-50 show the before/after). Blast.withoutIndexWait(work) replaces zenit's Models.withoutIndexWait and throws IndexWaitRefused instead of Models.NotYetRegistered (lines 55-57). 2026-10-20-cold-start-world-moves-to-protoblast-test-support.md: ColdStartWorld/FreshClassWorld move to be.elevenways.protoblast.testsupport.coldstart.ColdStartWorld, compile(dir, index, fixtures, needed...) takes the index source as its own argument, testClasspath no longer takes BlastAutoLoadInit.class/Blast.class, and BlastAutoLoadInit.class.getName() becomes ColdStartWorld.INDEX (lines 100-118). 2026-10-20-soft-badges-are-the-floor.md: pl-badge tone is typed BadgeTone defaulting to quiet, a count uses tone=\\\"count\\\" (never solid), CmsTemplateIds.CELL_BOOLEAN_BADGE is now CELL_BOOLEAN_MARK with cell/boolean-mark, and a nav attention metric's pill is its pl-badge child (lines 177-190). 2026-10-20-declaration-bodies-end-at-their-last-content.md: hawkeye trims formatting whitespace at both braces of a template/snippet body, so rendered HTML and text baselines lose a trailing space and an empty-slot host matches :empty; a needed separator goes in the parent or as {{ \\\" \\\" }} (lines 244-254). 2026-10-20-form-unsaved-changes.md: edited forms carry data-hwk-unsaved and ask before soft navigation, so Playwright tests must accept the dialog; NavigationProtection.Guard becomes NavigationGuard in be.elevenways.hawkeye.common, and scripted saves use FormChanges.collectForSave/FormChanges.saved (lines 310-325). 2026-10-20-partial-controls-keep-forms-unsaved.md: a control answering TakesFormValues.submissionHoldsAll() false after an edit keeps the form unsaved, so tests that leave must accept the dialog and custom controls dispatch a bubbling input event via PlumageField.announceEdit (lines 366-372). 2026-10-20-model-resolve-display-titles.md: resolveDisplayTitles(rows, chain, reader) is the seam, the other title methods are final, and overrides move to resolveDisplayTitle(row, chain) or resolveDisplayTitles, with page forms getDisplayTitles/items/recordTitles replacing per-row loops (lines 466-501). 2026-10-20-narration-related-titles-for-their-viewer.md: a BelongsTo key is titled only for a viewer who may read the related record, ChangeContext gains viewer as a new last component, and FieldValueText.text gains a viewer form (lines 555-565). 2026-10-20-settings-section-order-nav-shape-icon-mark.md: settings sections draw groups in declared order and refuse an unnamed sibling at boot, HistoryText.detail requires a HistoryDetailPlace, and pl-icon-mark replaces hand-drawn tinted icon circles (lines 637-649). 2026-10-20-placement-surface-accepts-record-handles.md: PlacementSurface gains abstract acceptsRecordHandles() with no default and ZenitRefusalReason gains AMBIGUOUS, so anonymous surfaces and exhaustive switches must be updated (lines 682-698). 2026-10-20-browser-failure-capture.md: failure captures now write \u003cname\u003e-page\u003cN\u003e.png and \u003cname\u003e.pages.txt for every open page, and test-owned browsers/contexts/pages register through FailureCaptureExtension.closeAfterTest instead of try-with-resources or finally (lines 737-755). 2026-10-20-mcp-tools-name-records-by-handle.md: MCP tools name records by 8-character handles, requiring UuidField.withHandle() plus a transaction-free addRecordHandle migration, OperationForms.recordId inputs, and context.text() for ids/moments/bytes (lines 805-815). 2026-10-19-jvm-templates-never-run-the-autoload-index.md: a JVM template's static initializer no longer runs the autoload index, so registries read on the JVM must be Registry.autoLoaded/KeyedRegistry.autoLoaded and WidgetAccess.setResolver becomes WidgetAccess.SEAM.install (lines 867-883). 2026-10-19-fixed-backend-classes-follow-the-datasource-tier.md: fixed-backend test classes are SKIPPED outside --datasources all, with no test-code change needed; prove backend changes with zenit-dev test --datasources all (lines 920-923).\", \"ranges\": [[34, 50], [55, 57], [100, 118], [177, 190], [244, 254], [310, 325], [366, 372], [466, 501], [555, 565], [637, 649], [682, 698], [737, 755], [805, 815], [867, 883], [920, 923]]}"